  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into small chunks. Cut capsicum and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, zest lemon to get a good pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• Slice haloumi into 1cm-slices. In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and the garlic & herb seasoning (see ingredients). Add haloumi, tossing to coat.\n• In a small bowl, combine a squeeze of lemon, the lemon zest, a drizzle of olive oil and the golden goddess dressing. Season, then set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62bbbf8e889ac2edf406f4cc/step-a253e925.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, combine the water and vegetable stock powder.\n• Bring to the boil, then add couscous. Stir to combine, then cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff couscous up with a fork. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62bbbf8e889ac2edf406f4cc/step-759b5fb2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat. Add the honey, dried oregano (see ingredients) and sesame seeds, turning haloumi to coat. Set aside.\n• To the couscous pan, add roasted veggies, the salad leaves and the dressing mixture. Gently toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62bbbf8e889ac2edf406f4cc/step-bdb1e75f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide lemony roasted veggie couscous between bowls.\n• Top with herbed honey and sesame haloumi, spooning over any extra glaze from the pan.\n• Serve with a dollop of garlic sauce and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62bbbf8e889ac2edf406f4cc/step-f28715f2.jpg"
    }
  ]
